   "verdict": "REAL",
   "failure_scenario": "A rebase or merge conflicts inside .gitmodules itself, which happens when both sides edited it. The cleanup step then cannot parse the conflict-marked file and throws before it can abort, so the checkout is left mid-rebase (or mid-merge) and the user gets an unclear 'Cannot inspect submodule configuration' error instead of a clean conflict result.",
   "reproduction": {
