   "evidence": "command.ts:131 calls submoduleFlags for any `rebase` or `merge` command, including `rebase --abort` (repos.ts:427) and `merge --abort` (engine.ts:634, the production review-round path after prepareMerge reports conflicts). submoduleFlags runs `git config --file=.gitmodules` and throws on any exit code other than 0 or 1 (line 176), which includes the exit for a config file with conflict markers. Base had no such call before abort. rebaseOnto has no production caller, but merge --abort in engine.ts goes through the same mechanism."
